ack via @MainActor send"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your domain types and database stay in your app. Swidux provides the contracts, observability, and dispatch loop.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Companion Packages","anchor":"Companion-Packages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Vendor-specific adapters live in their own repositories so a third-party SDK never enters the core dependency graph. Each ships a drop-in service conformer plus a preview mock, and publishes its own DocC reference:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/"},{"type":"text","text":" — RevenueCat adapter for the paywall plugin ("},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and the "},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sheet). See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginPaywallReference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/"},{"type":"text","text":" — Mixpanel adapter for the analytics plugin ("},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalyti